Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.85,0:00:03.65,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,By going on that \Nfun class trip together...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:05.95,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:09.99,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,...has brought us closer \Nthan ever before!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:11.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:13.42,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Have you recovered \Nfrom post-trip exhaustion?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:14.24,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:15.78,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,And you, Suzuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:18.98,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Or that's how it could've been, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:22.29,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:24.03,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,"Suzuki-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:26.13,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,1)\pos(472,327)\fnComic Sans MS\fs36\c&H8AFFDC&\shad0\bord3\3c&H888D12&}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:27.88,Flashback,Tani; flashback,0,0,0,,Miyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:35.01,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But, Suzuki-san, you called me \Nby my last name just now, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:36.89,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Really? Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:40.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, we are at school, \Nso, you know, it's a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:42.38,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:46.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If it were just the two of us, \Nwell, then of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:50.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Of course, Tani-kun, you'd \Ncertainly be more... you know? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:53.28,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Please don't set the bar too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:58.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Even if there weren't any leaps \Nin growth or sudden developments...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:01.15,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I do feel that there were \Nsmall, positive changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:02.53,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,What's come over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:07.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I am creating a summary of the historical\N artifacts of cultural significance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:09.40,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Japanese wabi-sabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.17,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Sato, your handwriting is so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:12.61,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:14.16,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Why are you the one acting proud?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:17.97,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,That's so true!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:24.44,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial Black\fs20\shad0\c&HC3ACF2&\3c&H6E1699&}I might just be imagining it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:23.65,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I feel like Azuma's putting off \Nless negative aura than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:24.44,Default,SIGN; in bubble,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\shad0\fnArial\bord1.5\b1\fs16\an8\pos(459.636,24.545)\c&HF17DD5&\3c&HF6D9E6&}HEH HEH HEH...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:28.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs18\pos(496.616,238.307)\frz14.94\c&H8D7009&\3c&HD0FFE5&}AFTER SCHOOL
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.63,Default,Saotome,0,0,0,,Tani, did you already order \Nyour class trip photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:28.69,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:30.48,Default - Top,Saotome; background; adlib,0,0,0,,Tani, have you looked at the photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:33.69,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Tani-kun's social circle has expanded \Na little without my noticing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:31.78,Default - Top,Tani; background; adlib,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.78,0:01:33.69,Default - Top,Saotome; background; adlib,0,0,0,,You should.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.69,0:01:36.72,Default,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,You should order this one and \Nthis one. You look great in them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:40.45,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs14\b1\shad0\pos(349.818,254)\c&H996E17&\3c&HF9FDD6&}THEY WERE IN THE BIG ROOM WITH HIM
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.31,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I know you don't really think that. \NI'm not buying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:46.58,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\shad0\bord1.5\an8\fnArial Black\fs30\frz5.791\c&HDE58EF&\3c&HFBEBFD&\pos(410.667,15.151)}STARE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:43.67,Default,Saotome,0,0,0,,Suzuki is staring for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:45.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to see Tani-kun \Nlooking good in a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:49.51,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What kind of photo is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:52.63,Default,Saotome,0,0,0,,It's the one we had the camera guy \Ntake in the big room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:55.76,Default,Hasegawa,0,0,0,,That's the alternate version.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You're all idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:02:00.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, if you're not buying these, \Nthen I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.29,0:02:01.96,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You don't have to buy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.48,0:02:06.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Which other ones should I buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:10.36,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,If you order too many, \Nit can cost quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:14.16,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's right. After our \Nmiddle school class trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:16.57,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Gapacho ordered photos of just scenery,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:18.51,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,which caused some\N parent-related trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:19.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Photos of just scenery?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Gapacho sure has refined taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:22.74,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:25.12,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,1)\an9\fnArial\fs12\b1\c&H404040&\3c&HFFFEFF&\4c&HD5BA68&}HE DOESN'T WANT PHOTOS OF HIMSELF.\NHE WANTS A RECORD OF THE TRIP.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:28.62,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not in many photos, \Nso I guess this'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:30.21,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh? There's a lot of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:30.79,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:35.67,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\fs16\b1\pos(271.334,330.667)\frz7.648\3c&H4644E1&}ORDER
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.73,0:02:34.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ignore those! You get it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:39.18,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,There won't be any student council \Nwork for a while, so I can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:43.66,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Ever since they made me class rep while \NI was out sick, I've disliked my class,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:46.72,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,but when all's said and done, \Nthe trip was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:50.07,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:05.49,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,So... where are you going on your outing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:06.55,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.63,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:26.30,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\an8\pos(320,98)}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:42.90,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:45.62,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Want to go hang out somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.88,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:51.15,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It's not like me at all, \Nbut should I do it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:54.26,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Dress fashionably...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.39,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,A long time ago, Mom said...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:05:03.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\shad0\bord3\an9\pos(524,38.667)\c&H1E63ED&\3c&HE8F1FD&}SMILE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:05:00.48,Flashback,Nishi's mom,0,0,0,,Oh, what's this? \NWhy are you all dressed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:03.69,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,And ever since then, \NI've felt vaguely embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:03.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,1)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\pos(132,175.333)\c&H8B440A&\3c&HFAF1EC&\frz9.44}Is it weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:07.79,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I've hardly ever worn this dress. \NShould I wear it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:12.07,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Will it be okay? \NIs it weird for me to wear this?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.07,0:05:14.87,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I focus on how easy \Nthings are to wear, so I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:15.45,Default,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\bord3\c&HA22652&\3c&HFBF9F6&}EX: ON THE CLASS TRIP
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:15.32,Default,SIGN; second line; left to right,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\b1\shad0\pos(224,126)\c&H84009E&\3c&HFFDCF1&}LOUNGEWEAR
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:15.32,Default,SIGN; second line; left to right,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs20\shad0\pos(302,277)\c&HEEB8F3&\3c&HA22855&}BASICALLY THE SAME
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.49,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Wearing what you want is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:17.12,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,390)\fnArial Black\shad0\fs30\frz15.98\pos(158.857,78.572)\c&HCAFFFE&\3c&H7C2AD7&}YAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:21.47,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,If people put you into random genres or \Nsay other clothes look better, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:24.16,Default,SIGN. left,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,340)\an1\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\c&H7A1BEF&\3c&HFAEEFC&\pos(209.143,146.762)}GRIT...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:23.91,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:24.46,Default,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fad(490,1)\an9\fnArial\fs16\shad0\bord1.5\c&H49036D&\3c&HE4C6EE&\b1\pos(560.973,29.404)\frz7.205}HON-CHAN IS ALWAYS\NIN MY HEART...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:26.13,Italics - Top,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Since I have the chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:30.97,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs12\fad(740,1)\pos(345.667,286)\b1\c&H8B03A3&\3c&HF5EFF9&}BOUGHT WHAT SEEMED PRETTY AT THE TIME, SO THEY'RE ALL DIFFERENT STYLES
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:30.97,Italics - Top,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'll wear some of the accessories \NI bought without a plan for using them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.18,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:37.43,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:40.50,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:44.65,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,My heart's racing and it just won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.15,0:05:50.38,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:52.24,Default,Nishi's mom,0,0,0,,What? You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:54.31,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:58.74,Default,SIGN; box,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs12\pos(85.866,208.4)\c&H303030&\3c&HFEFEFE&\4c&HD5B962&}ALL DECKED OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:57.51,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I managed to leave \Nwithout my family seeing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.78,0:05:58.74,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\shad0\fad(490,1)\an8\pos(88.534,48.133)\c&HB5A1F2&\3c&H7A0398&}WHEW...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:01.74,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It's only when I thought of \Nwearing this to go out
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.74,0:06:05.44,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,that I first realized I don't have \Na jacket or shoes to match these clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:11.76,Default,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\b1\shad0\c&H8133D6&\3c&HF7EEFF&\pos(444.707,245.388)}COAT BOUGHT TO WEAR\NWITH SCHOOL UNIFORM
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:11.76,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\b1\shad0\c&H8133D6&\3c&HF7EEFF&\pos(215.907,280.055)}SNEAKERS BOUGHT\N TO WEAR FOR P.E. (OUTSIDE)
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.44,0:06:08.05,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I bought them because\NI thought each one was cute,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.05,0:06:11.77,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,so I didn't think about how they'd \Ncoordinate with what I already had.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.17,0:06:11.76,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs12\b1\shad0\c&H6413AF&\3c&HECBDFF&\pos(452.707,120.055)}THEY SHOULD BE MORE LIKE...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:15.39,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.76,0:06:19.26,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs14\frz14.94\c&H085AEC&\3c&HCEF5FD&\pos(480.616,237.164)}THE STATION WHERE THEY'RE MEETING
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.76,0:06:18.98,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I never really noticed before...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:19.76,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad2\fnArial Black\fs36\c&H91FFF8&\3c&H830872&\4c&HFAF3FA&\pos(15,78.308)}SHOWY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:19.76,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\an6\shad2\fnArial Black\fs36\c&H91FFF8&\3c&H830872&\4c&HFAF3FA&}SHOWY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.53,0:06:23.37,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,but all the girls walking down the street \Nlook so fashionable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:20.22,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\an4\shad2\fnArial Black\fs36\c&H91FFF8&\3c&H830872&\4c&HFAF3FA&\pos(15,234.769)}SHOWY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:20.22,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad2\fnArial Black\fs36\c&H91FFF8&\3c&H830872&\4c&HFAF3FA&\pos(620,98.615)}SHOWY
