Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:30.73,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs12\an1\shad0\fnArial\fad(530,1)\pos(187.429,193.428)\c&H585655&\3c&HFEFEFE&\b1\frz14.02}I'm here! \NWhere are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:34.75,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Um... I'm here, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.73,0:06:38.22,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm at the top of the back escalator \Non the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:38.74,Default,SIGN; sticker,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial Black\pos(365.143,55.714)\frz19.92\c&HFA92E4&\3c&HBE564A&}GO{\c&HFBB28C&}OD {\c&HFA92E4&}NIG{\c&HFBB28C&}HT
