Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:48.76,Default,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\bord2\b1\fs20\pos(315.429,145.429)\frz13.65\c&HEFEFEF&\3c&H302A2B&}Nishi-san
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:48.76,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\bord2\an8\fs12\frz13.65\c&HEFEFEF&\pos(332.044,202.044)\3c&H302A2B&}Incoming call
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:50.81,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hello? Nishi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.65,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did you get lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.23,Italics,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:56.51,Italics,Yamada,0,0,0,,What? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:07:02.01,Italics,Nishi,0,0,0,,Um, at the top of the escalators, \Nthere's a... you might call it a plaza?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:08.36,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,She's never gonna look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.71,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm standing beside the ticket gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:12.72,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:14.49,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What? The reception isn't very—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:16.00,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:17.66,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Why are you being so formal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:19.03,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,And why'd you scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.03,0:07:22.01,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I thought I'd bumped \Ninto someone I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.01,0:07:24.63,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,But you were speaking \Npolitely before that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:27.79,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Are you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:29.91,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Are you really asking that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:32.71,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:37.17,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You mean "yeah."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:44.80,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Wait. Now that I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:49.01,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,is Yamada-kun's hair \Na little different than usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:50.46,Default - Top,Yeti,0,0,0,,He put a lot of work into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:55.03,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,No, hang on. \NWhat does it usually look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:08:00.67,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, I don't\Nusually look him in the eye when we talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:01.45,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\pos(332.308,238.615)\frz358\c&HDF6905&\3c&HF8F3EE&}SHE LOOKS AT THIS AREA
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:08.20,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fax-.2\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\frz20.31\c&H7DB7D1&\3c&H622F14&\4c&HA55028&\move(322,172,307.231,158.308)}CHINATOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:08.20,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Going to a place I've never been before...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.81,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,wearing something other \Nthan my uniform...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.21,0:08:13.31,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,walking together, just us two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:20.60,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,He feels even more like someone \Nfrom a different world than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:26.10,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Is it weird that I'm the one \Nwalking next to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:27.41,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:30.87,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I am feeling peck— ry. Hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:33.94,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,If you're feeling peckry, \Nlet's grab something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:39.41,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I was going to say "peckish" \Nand changed midway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:41.13,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I totally understand-ry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:43.27,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh! That looks yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:46.57,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, I know it's kinda late to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:48.67,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,but is it okay that \Nwe went where I wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:49.48,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.87,0:08:53.93,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,For some reason, I was really \Ncraving a good meat bun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:55.38,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Well, it has gotten colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:56.63,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.57,Default,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1330)\fnArial Black\shad0\pos(288,61.692)\c&HB7EBFA&\3c&H1A283F&}AWARD WINNING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.57,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1330)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\pos(149.538,61.385)\c&H4BAFC3&\3c&H1A283F&\4c&H3827BC&}XIAO
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.57,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1330)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\pos(471.538,61.385)\c&H69C9E2&\3c&H212E70&\4c&H3827BC&}XIAO
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.57,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1330)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\pos(471.538,148.385)\c&H69C9E2&\3c&H212E70&\4c&H3827BC&}LONG
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.57,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1330)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\pos(149.538,148.385)\c&H69C9E2&\3c&H212E70&\4c&H3827BC&}LONG
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.57,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1330)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\pos(471.538,228.385)\c&H69C9E2&\3c&H212E70&\4c&H3827BC&}BAO
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.57,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1330)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\pos(149.538,228.385)\c&H69C9E2&\3c&H212E70&\4c&H3827BC&}BAO
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.57,Default,SIGN; square,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1330)\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord1\fs14\pos(394,185.334)\c&H2119BD&\3c&HD8D1FA&\frz352.7}ULTIMATE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:09:00.54,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm always eating steamed stuff \Nfrom the convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:04.44,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,but the other day, on my way home,\None of the houses smelled like meat buns...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:07.39,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,And that's when I thought, \N"Oh, yeah! Chinatown!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:11.29,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,The convenience store I usually \Ngo to is where Taira works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.29,0:09:14.15,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Taira-kun. The boy with brown hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:17.27,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,And then Mini had \NMorimo dying of laughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.27,0:09:21.15,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Through Yamada-kun, I'm learning \Nmore and more people's names.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:24.40,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,And then, when I told Gapacho about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:27.09,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Wait. I was the only one talking. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.09,0:09:27.87,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:32.89,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,"Steamed stuff" \Nfrom the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:33.53,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:38.67,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's just, I was wondering why you \Ncalled the meat buns "steamed stuff."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.67,0:09:41.15,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Well, there's pizza buns \Nand stuff, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:42.93,Default,SIGN; top right,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\shad0\pos(605.09,120.909)\c&H31559A&\3c&HB7ECFE&\b1}NIKUMAN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:42.93,Default,SIGN; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\shad0\c&H2A3CEE&\3c&HB7ECFE&\b1\pos(567.999,265.636)}PIZZA BUNS
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:42.93,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\shad0\c&H2B405C&\3c&HB7ECFE&\b1\pos(387.636,111.455)}STEAMED\NSTUFF
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:42.92,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,1)\fnArial\b1\fs12\c&H303030&\3c&HFEFEFE&\4c&HD5B962&\pos(98.23,48.4)}YAMADA'S\NPERSONAL RULES
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:42.47,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:44.67,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,470)\shad0\bord3\an8\fnArial Black\fs30\c&HB83EED&\3c&HFEEDFA&\pos(140.122,29.696)\frz16.67}STARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:45.05,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:47.24,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,The smell of food from \Nother people's houses...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.24,0:09:50.36,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I can understand smelling something \Nlike curry, but meat buns?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.93,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,No, you can definitely smell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.93,0:09:55.04,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Haven't you ever run into someone \Non the train who got takeout?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:57.40,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It's that smell! That guilty smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:00.09,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,"Oh, yeah! Chinatown!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.09,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,What's with the time lag?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.69,0:10:06.23,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,If you wait too long, \NI can't remember what I was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:07.32,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:11.55,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It was funny, but I wasn't sure \NI should interrupt, so I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.97,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Interrupt! Interrupt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:15.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Taking these time-delayed jabs \Nfeels kinda embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:18.33,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,"That guilty smell."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:19.96,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You're laughing at that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:25.08,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Where did you go in your free time \Non the class trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:30.21,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Um, I went to a comedy show, \Ntook photos in front of the signs...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.85,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,visited the electronics district...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:36.69,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Really? Most of my class went to \NUltra Super Jumbo Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:40.45,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,The photo you sent me of \Nthe Inupii troop made me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.45,0:10:44.57,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It was fine buying those, but there's no \Nother opportunity to use them, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:50.13,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Just a little while ago, \NI was nervous because this isn't school,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:51.96,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,but that anxiety has gradually lessened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:57.83,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,This situation, where there isn't anyone \Nelse I know, actually feels comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:55.94,Default - Top,Yamada; background,0,0,0,,I can't get the background in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.87,Default - Top,Nishi; background,0,0,0,,What if you turned it sideways?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.34,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if he felt the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:10.93,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, let's head over to that bridge, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:31.91,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:34.65,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It's pretty nice, right? This view.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:35.94,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:40.92,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs12\an9\pos(568.909,159.818)\b1\c&H0F3FBF&\3c&H94E9F6&}Can't pay attention\N to the scenery right now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:40.11,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I can't do this. \NMy heart's going to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:42.65,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I can't look at his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:44.42,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:46.46,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It's cold near the ocean, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.79,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun is behaving normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:53.80,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Am I the only one whose emotions \Nare racing around like idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.57,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:11:59.69,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:11.30,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:12.19,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:13.57,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,She's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:16.09,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Wait! Nishi-san, you dropped something!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:20.05,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,That scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:25.66,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Things got weird at the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:29.13,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Um, sorry my curfew is so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:31.90,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,No, that's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:33.47,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Can you breathe okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.47,0:12:36.60,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Earlier, \Nwhen you were running...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:39.05,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,you dropped all kinds of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.73,0:12:43.44,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You didn't wear these today, right? \NDo you always walk around with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.23,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.73,0:12:47.66,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Since you have them, \Nyou should put them on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:48.37,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.62,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It'll look cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:50.74,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:52.30,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It's all fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:54.71,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, the fluffiness is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:59.95,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh? This is hard! Girls are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:02.01,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Oh. Sorry. It turned out weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:04.82,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:08.12,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,this way, you'll look me in the eye more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.38,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Nishi-san, you hardly ever \Nlook me in the eye, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:16.80,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,That's not a problem with my bangs. \NIt's a problem with my personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.25,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:23.02,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I'll make sure our gazes... meet-ry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:25.66,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,You say that, but your eyes are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:26.90,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,F-From now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:28.38,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,From now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:33.23,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Let's hang out again! Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:36.39,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.17,0:13:48.38,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:59.06,Default,SIGN; yeti,0,0,0,,{\fad(570,1)\fnArial\b1\fs14\shad0\c&H3C3237&\3c&HEBDDB6&\pos(100.382,308.096)}EXPLANATION
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:59.06,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs14\frz14.94\c&H085AEC&\3c&HCEF5FD&\pos(480.616,237.164)}THE STATION WHERE THEY'RE MEETING
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:59.06,Default - Top,Yeti,0,0,0,,While Yamada and Nishi \Nwere meeting at the station...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:02.15,Default - Top,Yeti,0,0,0,,on that same day, about an hour earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:05.92,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow! What a view!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:09.03,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,A blue sky. An ocean view.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:11.20,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,A popular sightseeing spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.24,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,This really is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:15.75,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,super overtly a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:20.30,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do? \NMy heart is pounding so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:23.51,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,On the class trip, there were times \Nit was just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:27.59,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,but we were basically always doing things \Nas a group, so there were people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:31.55,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,680)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\b1\an4\frz21.48\c&HDCCDF1&\3c&H914ACE&\pos(423.239,187.562)}GLOMP...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:33.88,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Is it okay if just for today \NI indulge in being really close?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:36.47,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It's fine, right? I think it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:40.06,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(940,690)\fnComic Sans MS\fs18\b1\shad0\bord3\pos(452.364,115.091)\c&H9B1598&\3c&HEBB4F2&}NO REACTION...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:44.61,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\b1\fs18\fad(490,1)\an8\frz340.1\move(373.176,29.764,338.176,29.764)\c&H5B50ED&\3c&HF8F9F4&}S\NN\NU\NG\NG\NL\NE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.74,0:14:43.76,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Okay! Today, I just don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.61,0:14:47.11,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fax-.2\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\b1\frz20.31\c&H7DB7D1&\3c&H622F14&\4c&HA55028&\move(322,172,311.802,162.308)}CHINATOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:47.11,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:49.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow, those look yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:48.62,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,240)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\frz334.5\pos(400,89.429)\c&H802DEC&\3c&HEFDDF5&}SNUG
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:52.61,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,we're a little ways away from \Nwhere we live, and it's just us two.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.61,0:14:55.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I want to try some fried xiao long bao.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.12,Default,SIGN; top right,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fay.1\an3\fs14\pos(622.857,33.429)\c&H3256E0&\3c&HFEFEFE&\4c&HFEFEFE&}SHARK FIN SHENG JIAN BAO
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.12,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\shad0\bord0\fay.1\c&H2B6AB7&\b1\pos(460.891,160.882)}4 pc
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.12,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\shad0\fay.1\c&H49618E&\b1\3c&HFFFEFF&\pos(582.122,172.574)}yen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.12,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\shad0\fay.1\c&H49618E&\b1\3c&HFFFEFF&\pos(591.968,208.882)}yen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.12,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\shad0\bord0\fay.1\c&H2B6AB7&\b1\pos(461.506,195.959)}6 pc
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.12,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\bord0\fay.1\c&H2B6AB7&\b1\pos(499.66,200.882)}tax inc.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.12,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\bord0\fay.1\c&H2B6AB7&\b1\pos(497.814,167.036)}tax inc.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:55.12,Default,SIGN; bottom left,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fay.1\an1\fs14\c&H3256E0&\3c&HFEFEFE&\4c&HFEFEFE&\pos(173.627,229.737)}SEAFOOD AND PORK COMBO
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-han, whatcha fancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:15:00.03,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I have to enjoy this break \Nfrom everyday life!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:14:59.56,Default - Top,Tani; background,0,0,0,,The spring rolls look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:02.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Those would be good, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.87,0:15:03.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:09.88,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\fs16\b1\pos(467.077,47.231)\c&H7E0DD6&\3c&HE6D0F8&}PERFECT VISION
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.11,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Should we have lunch here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:10.79,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.88,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnArial Black\shad0\frz11.65\pos(390.001,86.666)\c&HAEFFFD&\3c&H6B3437&}FWIP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:12.88,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:13.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:17.36,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Don't speak. Don't turn around. \NMove exactly as I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:18.39,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Is that a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:20.97,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Go into the restaurant \Nwithout making a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.97,0:15:21.61,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.13,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I totally understand-ry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:31.57,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,140)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\bord1\fs18\an8\pos(266.667,124)\frz13.08\c&HBA21BA&\3c&HFDECFC&}EVERYDAY LIFE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:27.06,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:30.79,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I was in uncommon \Nlovey-dovey girlfriend mode today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:34.66,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Hang on! Did those two start dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:37.91,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Or is this that delicate period \Nbefore dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:42.20,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Either way, them being on a date \Nmeans it's all going super well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:44.17,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\fax-.3\fad(480,1)\an8\frz12.02\c&H91FFC1&\3c&H902752&\4c&H902752&\pos(228.363,40.909)}HEH HEH HEH...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:44.17,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:45.67,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I see. I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:49.06,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,It'd make me happy if they \Nmade an announcement later!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.26,0:15:48.18,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\shad0\fad(240,240)\move(509.091,168.182,221.818,128.182)\c&HDDCCF5&\3c&H6B2BCD&}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:52.67,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's great that the skies \Nwere clear today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:53.62,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:58.18,Default,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\an8\frz3.789\pos(410.909,24.546)\c&HB02175&\3c&HEEEFF2&}JUST RECENTLY
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:58.18,Default,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\bord1\fnArial Black\fs12\shad0\an8\c&HD4ACF4&\3c&H9343CC&\frz329.8\pos(468.409,77.546)}GLOMP
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.49,0:15:59.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:01.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:03.10,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.85,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Like, getting excited about a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.85,0:16:05.94,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.77,0:16:12.11,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:17.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,a bayside night view feels like such \Nan adult sort of date, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.55,0:16:19.62,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Because you're using \Nso many English words?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:23.78,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,But you're right. \NI feel like I've grown a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.78,0:16:25.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:28.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The date is so date-like, \Nit's sort of embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:29.44,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:38.39,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I wonder if Yamada \Nand Nissan will come here later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:41.33,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,If he tried sweet-talking her \Nin a fancy spot like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:44.18,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'd melt \Nand be totally bowled over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:47.40,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Actually, what if they're \Nnearby right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:49.09,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I guess not, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:50.65,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:51.56,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:52.52,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,The view.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:54.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Y-Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:57.91,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:17:00.35,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,do you want to go over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:06.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.87,0:17:11.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow! This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.58,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Very urban.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:17.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I've always quietly thought about riding\Na Ferris wheel with someone special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:18.31,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:19.68,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, I lie. Roaringly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:21.14,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Roaringly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:23.43,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs18\shad0\fad(480,1)\pos(308.267,185.2)\c&H963CE4&\3c&HFCFBFD&}THAT GOT\NA LAUGH...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:26.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You see it a lot in live-action \Nmovie adaptations of shojo manga,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,so I've always wished I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:29.80,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Just live-action adaptations?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:31.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:36.16,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Just me and the person I love, \Nriding a Ferris wheel alone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.20,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I sat over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:42.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:51.43,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,The situation I've always \Nlonged to be in...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:18:00.22,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(940,1)\shad0\bord1.5\fnArial Black\an8\c&H45AFF4&\3c&HDDE9F2&}STARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.31,0:17:56.57,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,They're really staring at us, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:59.47,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I didn't know that Ferris wheel cars \Nwere so easy to see into.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:02.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let's take a photo for posterity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:08.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:12.69,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,The truth is, I wanted to be \Na little more lovey-dovey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:14.96,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,but I don't want to be a sideshow, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:18.49,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The illumination display \Nwas pretty, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:20.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We got our Christmas in early!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.65,0:18:21.99,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,For Christmas,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:27.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,it's that festive feeling leading up to \Nthe day of that's the most fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:29.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I love this time of year!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:32.25,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Jingle bells! Jingle bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:44.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Do you want to do\Nsomething specific for Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:45.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:49.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:54.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If it's the two of us... \Nthen anything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:57.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-kun, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:00.71,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I feel the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:08.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,As an aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.91,0:19:13.58,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,right now... there's no one around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.07,0:19:31.86,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\fs36\shad1\frz354.2\pos(341.538,164.77)\c&H9200B6&\3c&HB6FBFB&\4c&HB6FBFB&}WHOOM
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.89,0:19:35.61,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnArial Black\shad0\frz11.99\pos(454.153,107.076)\c&H71FFC3&\3c&H917A1D&}STOPPED
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:34.95,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,A-A car!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:37.56,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Argh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:39.36,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:41.89,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,Miyu! Yuusuke-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:43.86,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,My dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:47.34,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Th-That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:49.00,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't need dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:51.51,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,so the two of us went out to eat! \NIt's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:54.62,Default,Suzuki's dad,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-kun, your house \Nis this way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:57.47,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:19:58.88,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fax-.1\fnImpact\shad0\c&H0C99EF&\3c&HE7F7FF&\pos(486.833,63.333)\frz356.2}THUMP
