Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:05.98,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Wow, you rode the Ferris wheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:07.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The night view was gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:11.27,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,If only Ferris wheels spun faster, \Nthey'd be so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:13.74,Default - Top,Satou; background,0,0,0,,That'd turn them into \Nsomething else, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.62,0:20:13.96,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki, does that mean that \Nat last you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:18.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Exactly! A dream from my shojo manga \Nlive-action movie mania has come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.10,0:20:21.78,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nisshi, that pin is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:24.67,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, um... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:25.62,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:28.59,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,was your outing fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.59,0:20:30.28,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.28,0:20:32.56,Default,Morimo,0,0,0,,You went to Chinatown? I'm jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:35.41,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah. The meat buns were super good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:37.95,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,So, Yamada-kun went to Chinatown, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.33,0:20:39.76,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,Who'd he go with?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:42.21,Italics,Taira; internal,0,0,0,,No. I'm not asking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.06,0:20:48.43,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow. It's evening, but it kinda \Nalready seems like night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:52.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Your fingers are so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:56.16,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu-chan, why are you so warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:20:56.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\pos(332.667,154)\frz348.1\c&H8FFFF2&\3c&H5A079E&\4c&H5A079E&}PING
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:59.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yuusuke-han! Yuusuke-han! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:03.18,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,The "cozy and warm" lineup in \Nthe vending machine has increased!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:03.97,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs35\an8\c&HB5FBFD&\3c&H3853E7&\4c&H3853E7&}BOOM!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:03.97,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\pos(120.667,176)\c&HD9D4FF&\3c&H2F11D7&\b1}COCOA WITH CREAM
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:03.97,Default,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\fs8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H4483B4&\b1\frz12.77\pos(97.81,217.594)}COZY
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:03.97,Default,SIGN; center,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\b1\shad0\pos(318,86.666)\c&H1E486B&\3c&H99EEF2&}SATISFYING CORN POTAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:03.97,Default,SIGN; right top,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\b1\shad0\c&H0D1C8D&\3c&H67E4F5&\pos(516,103.999)}CONSOMME SOUP
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:03.97,Default,SIGN; right top,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\b1\shad0\c&HE3F9ED&\3c&H85CD8B&\pos(515.2,168.799)}BEEF FLAVOR
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:05.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:08.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Doesn't it drive home that feeling \Nthat the season has arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:08.70,Default,SIGN; on can,0,0,0,,{\fad(390,1)\fnTimes New Roman\fs8\b1\shad0\c&H1E486B&\3c&H99EEF2&\frz12.97\pos(483.6,92.266)}SATISFYING CORN POTAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.07,0:21:08.70,Default,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fnArial Black\shad0\fs18\an9\fad(390,1)\c&H8FECFC&\3c&H0E345B&\pos(564.4,167.257)\frz12.51}CORN POTAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:10.69,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You look forward to it every year?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.69,0:21:13.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yup! And I will be a steady \Npatron again this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:16.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you don't shake it a lot first,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.59,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,you won't be able to go back,\Nso be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.59,0:21:19.76,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,That much?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:25.01,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Just like I can feel the seasons changing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:28.35,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,I want to be able to treasure \Nthese small, positive changes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:32.22,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Miyu or Miyu-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:34.72,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,If you don't know which to use, \NI'm fine without.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:41.48,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\an1\shad0\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs18\pos(82.181,113.636)\frz13.15\c&HB8502F&\3c&HF0E3A3&}SO IT DIDN'T SEEM\N CASUAL AFTER ALL...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.48,0:21:43.33,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,You'd like that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:44.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:45.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That version...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.09,0:21:48.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,makes you more \Nself-conscious, Yuusuke-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:55.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What kind of reason is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:21:58.50,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Miyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.50,0:21:58.75,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,230)\fnArial Black\shad0\bord0\fs16\pos(356,136.4)\c&HF2EE15&}GLINT
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:01.35,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Is that his "I'm not embarrassed" face?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:04.67,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Little by little, things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:07.01,Default,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\an9\fnArial Black\c&H83FFFC&\3c&H9A39DC&\4c&H9A39DC&}SQUIGGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.96,0:22:14.53,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,There's just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:18.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And I'm the one who did the nurturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:22.02,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fad(350,1)\pos(390.153,153.077)\c&HB1FEFA&\3c&H992EE1&\4c&H632BCC&}HEH HEH...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:19.73,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Nurtured what?
